      For more than 35 years, S. Phaneuf & Associates has provided professional asphalt paving services for commercial properties and residential estates throughout Massachusetts. We install and improve driveways, parking lots, private roads, and industrial paved surfaces, with an emphasis on proper preparation, quality aggregate compaction, and long-term pavement performance.
